 ## Background
-The term "flat blocking multi-resolution strategy" is described as less traditional than "octree subdivision" [S1, S2, unofficial]. The concept of min|max octree has been used for decades to speed up volume ray-casting [S1, S2, unofficial]. The specific formulation with the variation formula is attributed to a Stack Overflow question and answer from 2012 [S1, S2, unofficial].
